{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#ffffff;--accent:#6b5fb6;--muted:#6b7280;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:#111}
    body{background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #fbfbfd 60%);background-attachment:fixed}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9b7de6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    .cta a{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto;padding:24px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:26px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,24,40,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px}

    /* Mood selector */
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}
    .mood{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #e6e6ef;background:transparent;color:#222;cursor:pointer;transition:all .18s}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#8f7ad6);color:white;border-color:transparent;transform:translateY(-3px)}

    /* Approach panel */
    .approach-title{font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
    .approach-desc{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0}
    .approach-bump{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .pill{background:#f4f6ff;color:#2b2b3a;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .price-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:6px 0}
    .switch{width:56px;height:30px;border-radius:40px;background:#e7e7f8;padding:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .knob{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:white;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(11,12,20,0.12);transition:transform .28s}
    .switch.monthly .knob{transform:translateX(4px)}
    .switch.package .knob{transform:translateX(28px)}
    .plan-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:10px;border:1px dashed #eef}
    .price{font-weight:800;font-size:20px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e7e9f1;font-size:14px}
    button[type=submit]{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .meta{margin-top:12px;color:#6b7280}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:#8b8f98}
    @media(max-width:920px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:0 12px}.card{padding:16px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">PT</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About Me</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees & Plans</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Help Q&A</a>
      <a href="book.html">Start a Session</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="cta"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h1>Let's find a way forward together</h1>
        <p class="lead">Practical, confidential conversation for the concerns you're carrying. Use the quick selectors on this page to see which approach might fit right now.</p>

        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">How are you feeling today?</div>
          <div class="moods" role="list">
            <button class="mood" data-key="drained">Drained</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="tangled">Tangled</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="stuck">Stuck</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="searching">Searching</button>
          </div>

          <div class="approach card" style="margin-top:10px;padding:14px">
            <div class="approach-title" id="approachTitle">Short Strategy Session</div>
            <div class="approach-desc" id="approachDesc">A focused 50-minute session to identify one concrete next step tailored to your immediate needs.</div>
            <div class="approach-bump">
              <span class="pill" id="approachFormat">Single session</span>
              <span class="small" id="approachTime">Flexible scheduling</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <a id="approachCTA" class="cta" style="text-decoration:none;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:white;display:inline-block" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?method=strategy">Book a 50-min Session</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:16px">
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">Quick contact</div>
          <form id="contactForm">
            <input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
            <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" required>
            <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)">
            <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="A short note about what brings you here"></textarea>
            <input type="hidden" name="mood" id="moodField">
            <button type="submit">Send a note</button>
            <div class="small meta">I usually reply within 48 hours. If you are in immediate danger or a life-threatening emergency, please contact local emergency services or a crisis line right away.</div>
          </form>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Pricing comparator</div>
            <div class="sub">Toggle to compare single-session monthly rates vs short packages</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Payments accepted by card</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="price-toggle">
            <div class="sub">Monthly</div>
            <div id="switch" class="switch monthly" role="switch" aria-checked="true">
              <div class="knob"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sub">Package</div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-row">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">Fresh Start</div>
              <div class="sub">Single session guidance</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price" id="priceA">$120</div>
              <div class="sub">per session</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-row">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">Clarity Package</div>
              <div class="sub">A bundle of 6 sessions for concentrated progress</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price" id="priceB">$690</div>
              <div class="sub">one-time</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Numbers animate to show the different rhythms of monthly care vs focused packages. No claims — just transparent options.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:16px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Contact details</div>
          <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div class="sub">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="meta" style="margin-top:8px">Sessions offered via secure telehealth. I maintain confidentiality within the usual legal and ethical limits.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="card" style="flex:1;min-width:260px">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Scope & boundaries</div>
        <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">I work with adults on a range of life shifts and mood concerns. My approach is collaborative and pragmatic. I do not provide emergency services, prescribe medication, or offer forensic evaluations.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="flex:1;min-width:260px">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Confidentiality</div>
        <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">Our conversations are confidential with exceptions required by law (e.g., safety concerns). If you want to know more about limits to privacy, I will be glad to explain before we begin work together.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>Serving people in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
    <div class="meta">Licensed clinician. This site is for introductory information and is not a substitute for professional evaluation. For crisis resources locally, call emergency services or your nearest crisis line.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    const moodMap = {
      drained: {
        title: 'Short Strategy Session',
        desc: 'A focused 50-minute session designed to restore short-term energy and build a single, manageable next step.',
        pill: 'Single session',
        time: '50 minutes',
        cta: 'Book a Strategy Session',
        href: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?method=strategy'
      },
      tangled: {
        title: 'Emotion-Focused Mapping',
        desc: 'A multi-week approach to help name patterns and untangle persistent emotional knots with steady support.',
        pill: '4–8 sessions',
        time: 'Weekly rhythm',
        cta: 'Start Emotion Mapping',
        href: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?method=emotion'
      },
      stuck: {
        title: 'Collaborative Therapy',
        desc: 'Structured weekly sessions aimed at identifying stuck points and practicing new ways of moving forward over time.',
        pill: 'Ongoing weekly',
        time: 'Planned course',
        cta: 'Begin Collaborative Work',
        href: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?method=weekly'
      },
      searching: {
        title: 'Decision-Focused Intensive',
        desc: 'An abbreviated bundle tailored to clarifying a single choice or next step over a concentrated period.',
        pill: '2–4 sessions',
        time: 'Condensed plan',
        cta: 'Book an Intensive',
        href: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?method=intensive'
      }
    };

    const moodButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
    const approachTitle = document.getElementById('approachTitle');
    const approachDesc = document.getElementById('approachDesc');
    const approachFormat = document.getElementById('approachFormat');
    const approachTime = document.getElementById('approachTime');
    const approachCTA = document.getElementById('approachCTA');
    const moodField = document.getElementById('moodField');

    moodButtons.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        moodButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        const key = btn.dataset.key;
        const spec = moodMap[key];
        // morph content
        approachTitle.textContent = spec.title;
        approachDesc.textContent = spec.desc;
        approachFormat.textContent = spec.pill;
        approachTime.textContent = spec.time;
        approachCTA.textContent = spec.cta;
        approachCTA.setAttribute('href', spec.href);
        moodField.value = key;
      });
    });

    // Pricing comparator animation
    const switchEl = document.getElementById('switch');
    const priceA = document.getElementById('priceA');
    const priceB = document.getElementById('priceB');
    let state = 'monthly'; // monthly or package

    const values = {
      monthly: {a:120, b:690},
      package: {a:100, b:620}
    };

    function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function tick(now){
        const elapsed = now - startTime;
        const t = Math.min(elapsed / duration, 1);
        const current = Math.round(start + (end - start) * (1 - Math.cos(t * Math.PI)) / 2);
        el.textContent = '$' + current;
        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    switchEl.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      state = state === 'monthly' ? 'package' : 'monthly';
      switchEl.classList.toggle('monthly', state === 'monthly');
      switchEl.classList.toggle('package', state === 'package');
      switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked', state === 'monthly');

      const from = state === 'monthly' ? values.package : values.monthly;
      const to = state === 'monthly' ? values.monthly : values.package;
      animateValue(priceA, from.a, to.a, 500);
      animateValue(priceB, from.b, to.b, 500);
    });

    // Form: prevent submit for demo but show selection
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    form.addEventListener('submit', (e)=>{
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      alert('Thanks — your note is ready to send. For demo, this site does not submit forms. Selected mood: ' + (data.get('mood') || 'not selected'));
    });

    // Initialize defaults
    document.querySelector('.mood[data-key="drained"]').click();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the Contact page and a brief developer note for the private_practice_therapist layout (chunk 4).

Files included:
- contact.html — self-contained contact page with interactive features.

Interactive features implemented (local JS & HTML only):
- Mood-to-Method selector: four mood buttons update the recommended approach panel and change the CTA label and destination query string. The selection is stored in a hidden input in the contact form.
- Pricing Comparator toggle: a small switch toggles between "monthly" and "package" views; numeric labels animate smoothly using requestAnimationFrame and a cosine easing for a pleasant effect.

Placeholders to replace before production:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes and constraints:
- No external assets or CDNs are referenced. The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg; include a unique pattern there when assembling the full site.
- The contact form is a demo (no backend). The submit handler prevents default submission and shows a small alert. Replace with your preferred submission endpoint or script.
- Content includes confidentiality, scope boundaries, and a crisis note. Avoid making medical claims or guarantees — the copy is intentionally measured and clinician-voiced.
- Navigation uses a distinct label set and correct links to other pages in the project (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html, contact.html).

Accessibility & behavior:
- Mood options are buttons for keyboard access and visible focus via native browser outlines.
- The pricing switch uses role="switch" and toggles aria-checked.

Styling & structure:
- All styling is inline within contact.html for portability. Adjust variables in the :root section to change color palette.

Integration tips:
- Provide an assets/img/pattern.svg file with an original pattern to match the rest of the project.
- Replace placeholder values server-side or during your templating build.
- Hook contact form submission to your secure backend or an email service; ensure proper handling of health-related information and HIPAA considerations where applicable.

If you want this page adapted to a specific brand palette or need the form wired to a particular backend (Netlify, Formspree, custom API), tell me which one and I will produce the wired version."}
BUNDLE_END
